5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. To ensure our chosen project has the hands it needs to succeed, I shall examine the staffing rolls for technical posts and minutes on secondments.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. I'm a bit nervous, but I'm happy to help. I'd like to look into the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and the closeout files of finished awards.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi! I want to make sure the labs and tools are actually working! I'll check the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and the incident logs on shared instrumentation.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A prudent start. To identify where our previous ambitions were thwarted by non-scientific friction, I shall review the portfolio review of schedule overruns and the national repository deposit turnaround.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I prefer to look at the evidence of delivery. I will examine the closeout files of finished awards and the station records from partner field sites.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,It seems we have a balanced approach. I am content with our selections.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,I agree. I think we are covering a lot of important ground.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,This is going to be great! I can't wait to see what's happening in the facilities!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. A multifaceted inquiry is the only way to avoid the pitfalls of optimism.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I have no further comments.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
